# CSS contract

- Consumers import `@scalewing/react/styles.css` once. They must not copy Scalewing CSS into their `src`.
- Class names are generated from tokens. `sw-padding-top-4` is spacing step `4`, not `4px`.
- Do not add arbitrary-value classes, a color-utility matrix, or a responsive class DSL without an ADR.
- React Native uses spacing step props, not CSS class names.
- Do not hand-maintain a parallel class sheet.
